      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesn't feel like it's \"shaping\" me though. it just feels like entropy. like, if you look at it objectively, the universe is just this massive, indifferent expanse where human suffering has zero net impact. if nothing we do actually matters in the grand scheme, then why is there this massive pressure to just keep struggling? it seems more logical to just accept the nothingness.",
