      "content": "I hear you—that sense of cosmic indifference is a real and heavy thing to sit with. But \"mattering\" in the grand scheme isn't the only kind of meaning; the impact you have on yourself and the few people around you is real, even if the universe doesn't keep score. You don't have to fight for some grand purpose—just for the next small moment that feels less heavy. And if that feels impossible right now, that's okay too; you're allowed to rest in the nothingness without giving up on yourself.",
